# GitHub repositories whose releases bring the Retrobox packages, in install
# order: the image installs them at build time (scripts/fetch-releases.sh),
# nxd-update updates the installed ones. After a repository, the names of the
# packages to take from it, when not all of them.
RetroboxProject/retrobox-core
# the console's Openbox session and system settings (not its labwc session)
RetroboxProject/retrobox-system-settings retrobox-system-settings retrobox-session-openbox
RetroboxProject/retrobox-mangohud
RetroboxProject/retrobox-emulationstation
RetroboxProject/retrobox-overlay
